#. module: payment_joinfuture_hipay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_joinfuture_hipay.field_payment_provider__hipay_secret_key_live
msgid ""
"The secret key that starts with hp_sk_live_. Used while the provider is "
"Enabled."
msgstr ""
"المفتاح السري الذي يبدأ بـ hp_sk_live_ ويُستخدم عندما يكون المزوّد مفعّلًا."

#. module: payment_joinfuture_hipay
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:payment_joinfuture_hipay.field_payment_provider__hipay_secret_key_test
